WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.930
What's up everybody!

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:02.930
We are Pongfinity

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:04.900
And today we won't be needing these

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.420
Because we are playing with other sports equipment.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.220
Let's find out which one is best for table
tennis!

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.560
I've been preparing for the big fight

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.960
Against the extremely lightweight champion.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:17.700
Skiing is not my strong point

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:21.020
But I'm sure that I can play table tennis
with this ski.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.100
We are going to play a match to 5 points

00:01:58.149 --> 00:02:00.149
I'm going to be using the badminton racket

00:02:00.149 --> 00:02:01.920
And I'm going to be using the tennis racket.

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.220
But first, we are going to need some practice.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:43.629
Okay I think next we'll have to play with
a frisbee.

00:03:43.629 --> 00:03:45.909
But since we only have one frisbee

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:47.900
That means me and Miikka will have to share
it.

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.100
This should be fun!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.480
Here is a challenge to all you football players
out there

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:55.030
I'm gonna see if it's possible to play

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.420
While bouncing the ball.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:43.009
Now that we are warmed up, it's time for the
big match.

00:05:43.009 --> 00:05:44.850
He is going to have no chance.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:46.560
We'll see that!

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:15.880
We had a lot of fun filming this episode

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:17.490
Let us know in the comments below

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:18.490
Which one was your favorite item!

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:21.240
If you enjoyed this episode make sure to leave
it a thumbs up!

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.720
Subscribe right here

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:24.240
